description: "immutable[5]: compiler_identity,ontology_identity,record_identity,version_history,provenance guarantees[5]: Every module references this specification.,No duplicated enumerations exist.,Constants remain backward compatible.,Compiler-wide terminology remains consistent.,Every identifier is globally unique."
spec:
  id: global_constants
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: critical
  module: Core
  compiler_stage: Foundation
  description: "\"Defines every compiler-wide constant, enumeration, identifier, priority, status, quality scale, confidence scale, risk scale, difficulty level, lifecycle state and global limits used by every subsystem of the TOON Dataset Compiler. No compiler module may redefine constants defined in this specification.\""
purpose: "\"Provide a single immutable source of truth for all compiler-wide constants to guarantee consistency, reproducibility and interoperability.\""
priority:
  P0: Critical
  P1: High
  P2: Medium
  P3: Low
  P4: Optional
severity:
  S0: Catastrophic
  S1: Critical
  S2: Major
  S3: Minor
  S4: Informational
risk:
  R0: None
  R1: Low
  R2: Medium
  R3: High
  R4: Extreme
confidence:
  C0: Unknown
  C1: Weak
  C2: Moderate
  C3: Strong
  C4: Proven
quality:
  Q0: Reject
  Q1: Poor
  Q2: Acceptable
  Q3: Good
  Q4: Excellent
  Q5: Gold
complexity:
  X0: Trivial
  X1: Simple
  X2: Moderate
  X3: Advanced
  X4: Expert
difficulty:
  D0: Beginner
  D1: Elementary
  D2: Intermediate
  D3: Advanced
  D4: Professional
  D5: Expert
  D6: Research
identifiers:
  KA: Knowledge_Atom
  EKR: Engineering_Knowledge_Record
  EW: Engineering_World
  EE: Engineering_Episode
  CO: Company
  RP: Repository
  TM: Team
  EN: Engineer
  LS: Lesson
limits:
  minimum_quality: Q2
  release_quality: Q4
  minimum_confidence: C2
  maximum_dependency_depth: unlimited
  graph_cycles: forbidden
  orphan_nodes: forbidden
future:
  extensible: true
  backward_compatible: true
  deterministic: true
  centralized: true
  immutable_core: true
